  },
  "x_midiTrs": "TYPE_A",
  "x_midiChannel": 1,
  "additionalInfo": "Prostage Remote WahWah manual §6.1 (Jan 2014). 5-pin DIN MIDI In + Out/Thru. Factory channel 1; Omni/channel via SysEx. MIDI Clock No/No — Auto Wah rate via Tap CC14 or SysEx speed. Pitch bend = Hi Res expression. Older sibling of WAHryTone (SysEx device byte 00 vs 01)."
